{
  "id": "draft.dialogue.chiyuki.greet",
  "kind": "dialogue",
  "title": "第一次工作，挨拶まわり",
  "status": "approved",
  "version": 1,
  "rootId": "draft.dialogue.chiyuki.greet",
  "payload": {
    "id": "dialogue.chiyuki.greet",
    "idolId": "chiyuki",
    "startNodeId": "1",
    "nodes": {
      "1": {
        "id": "1",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "（差不多到约定的时间了。）",
        "nextNodeId": "2"
      },
      "2": {
        "id": "2",
        "speakerId": "chiyuki",
        "text": "哈……哈……制作人先生，让您久等了～！",
        "nextNodeId": "3"
      },
      "3": {
        "id": "3",
        "speakerId": "chiyuki",
        "text": "对不起，杂货店的工作拖长了一点……",
        "nextNodeId": "4"
      },
      "4": {
        "id": "4",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "没关系，是准时。辛苦了。",
        "nextNodeId": "5"
      },
      "5": {
        "id": "5",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "那从现在开始集中在这边吧。抱歉，连休息时间都没多少。",
        "nextNodeId": "6"
      },
      "6": {
        "id": "6",
        "speakerId": "chiyuki",
        "text": "不会，我会努力的～！今天的工作是……挨个去打招呼吧？",
        "nextNodeId": "7"
      },
      "7": {
        "id": "7",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "嗯，是这样。我们事务所有参与一个活动，去跟主办方打个招呼。",
        "nextNodeId": "8"
      },
      "8": {
        "id": "8",
        "speakerId": "chiyuki",
        "text": "是……我能做好吗。",
        "nextNodeId": "9"
      },
      "9": {
        "id": "9",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "没问题，千雪一定行。别想太复杂，享受活动的气氛就好。",
        "nextNodeId": "10"
      },
      "10": {
        "id": "10",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "（对还不太了解偶像的千雪来说，让她看看舞台是最好的。）",
        "nextNodeId": "11"
      },
      "11": {
        "id": "11",
        "speakerId": "chiyuki",
        "text": "明、明白了。",
        "nextNodeId": "12"
      },
      "12": {
        "id": "12",
        "speakerId": "chiyuki",
        "text": "我叫桑山千雪，是新人的偶像。请多指教。",
        "nextNodeId": "13"
      },
      "13": {
        "id": "13",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "（千雪身上果然有东西啊……虽然紧张，却好好地笑着打了招呼。）",
        "nextNodeId": "14"
      },
      "14": {
        "id": "14",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "千雪，辛苦了。招呼打得很不错。",
        "nextNodeId": "15"
      },
      "15": {
        "id": "15",
        "speakerId": "chiyuki",
        "text": "谢谢您。听您这么说，我就放心了。",
        "choices": [
          {
            "label": "今天这样就很好。",
            "nextNodeId": "100"
          },
          {
            "label": "你的笑容很管用。",
            "nextNodeId": "110"
          },
          {
            "label": "下周还有更大的场",
            "nextNodeId": "120"
          }
        ]
      },
      "100": {
        "id": "100",
        "speakerId": "chiyuki",
        "text": "呵呵，是吗？那我放心了。",
        "nextNodeId": "101"
      },
      "101": {
        "id": "101",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "嗯。第一次能做到这样，已经很够了。",
        "nextNodeId": "102"
      },
      "102": {
        "id": "102",
        "speakerId": "chiyuki",
        "text": "那，下次我也照着这样来。"
      },
      "110": {
        "id": "110",
        "speakerId": "chiyuki",
        "text": "笑容……吗？",
        "nextNodeId": "111"
      },
      "111": {
        "id": "111",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "嗯，主办方第一句就夸了那个笑容。",
        "nextNodeId": "112"
      },
      "112": {
        "id": "112",
        "speakerId": "chiyuki",
        "text": "哎呀……那我得好好珍惜它才行呢。"
      },
      "120": {
        "id": "120",
        "speakerId": "chiyuki",
        "text": "更大的场……我，会紧张的吧。",
        "nextNodeId": "121"
      },
      "121": {
        "id": "121",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "紧张也没关系。今天的千雪，紧张着也笑出来了。",
        "nextNodeId": "122"
      },
      "122": {
        "id": "122",
        "speakerId": "chiyuki",
        "text": "……是。那我，会记得今天的感觉。"
      }
    }
  },
  "annotations": [],
